{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中，由傅季馨（Margaret）親自示範一道精緻惹味的「醬油蜂蜜煎馬友魚」。這道菜式做法簡單，但味道層次豐富，絕對適合大家在家中大顯身手！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>準備材料</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>烹飪步驟</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"000baf17-bedf-4ad7-8c8a-cfb397398612.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026TkaHoVAYBk1785209231.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"000baf17-bedf-4ad7-8c8a-cfb397398612.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"b3648314-1585-42e1-abae-3c670ea441f4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026hn110Suq2e1785209227.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"b3648314-1585-42e1-abae-3c670ea441f4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T01:19:02.779285+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}